{"id":"3e37d8fb642c97db","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-coanalytic-code.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive3 Coanalytic Code","display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-coanalytic-code — ZFC Descriptive3 Coanalytic Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-coanalytic-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive3-coanalytic-code"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-coanalytic-code — ZFC Descriptive3 Coanalytic Code","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-polish-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code]]","[[58-df-zfc-baire-space-basic-open]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-coanalytic-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-coanalytic-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive3-coanalytic-code — ZFC Descriptive3 Coanalytic Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"58-df-polish-space\">58-df-polish-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a54594b19acae3d\" href=\"?note=4a54594b19acae3d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code\">58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c99a52cfe56f7d8\" href=\"?note=6c99a52cfe56f7d8\" title=\"58-df-zfc-baire-space-basic-open\">58-df-zfc-baire-space-basic-open</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span> (coanalytic set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> (Borel code for the projected complement)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq X\\times\\omega^\\omega\">\\(B\\subseteq X\\times\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> (Borel set decoded by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,\\sigma)\">\\((Y,\\sigma)\\)</span> (auxiliary topological space used by the evaluation predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> (standard topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polish}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Polish}_S\\)</span> (Polish-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"58-df-polish-space\">58-df-polish-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3BorelCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3BorelCode}_S\\)</span> (Borel-code predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4a54594b19acae3d\" href=\"?note=4a54594b19acae3d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code\">58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BaireSpaceBasicOpen}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BaireSpaceBasicOpen}_S\\)</span> (basic-open predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6c99a52cfe56f7d8\" href=\"?note=6c99a52cfe56f7d8\" title=\"58-df-zfc-baire-space-basic-open\">58-df-zfc-baire-space-basic-open</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelEvaluation}_S\\)</span> (Borel-code evaluation predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3CoanalyticCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3CoanalyticCode}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}borel\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelEvaluation}_S(B;Y,\\sigma,c)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3BorelCode}_S(Y,\\sigma,c)\\land\\exists T,\\ell,E\\;\\Bigl(c=\\langle T,\\ell\\rangle\\land E:T\\to\\mathcal P(Y)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl((\\neg\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T))\\to E(s)=\\ell(s)\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\ell(s)=0\\to\\exists!n\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\land E(s)=Y\\setminus E(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle))\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\ell(s)=1\\to E(s)=\\bigcup\\{E(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle):n\\in\\omega\\land s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}\\bigr)\\land B=E(\\varnothing)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}borel\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelEvaluation}_S(B;Y,\\sigma,c)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3BorelCode}_S(Y,\\sigma,c)\\land\\exists T,\\ell,E\\;\\Bigl(c=\\langle T,\\ell\\rangle\\land E:T\\to\\mathcal P(Y)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl((\\neg\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T))\\to E(s)=\\ell(s)\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\ell(s)=0\\to\\exists!n\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\land E(s)=Y\\setminus E(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle))\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\ell(s)=1\\to E(s)=\\bigcup\\{E(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle):n\\in\\omega\\land s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}\\bigr)\\land B=E(\\varnothing)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3CoanalyticCode}_S(X,\\tau,c,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\tau_{\\mathcal B}=\\left\\{U\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega:\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{BaireSpaceBasicOpen}_S(N,s)\\land y\\in N\\land N\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\right\\}\\land\\exists\\sigma\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\times\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\sigma=\\left\\{W\\subseteq X\\times\\omega^\\omega:\\forall z\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_{\\mathcal B}\\;\\bigl(z\\in U\\times V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W\\bigr)\\right\\}\\land\\mathrm{BorelEvaluation}_S(B;X\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\sigma,c)\\land X\\setminus A=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3CoanalyticCode}_S(X,\\tau,c,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\tau_{\\mathcal B}=\\left\\{U\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega:\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{BaireSpaceBasicOpen}_S(N,s)\\land y\\in N\\land N\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\right\\}\\land\\exists\\sigma\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\times\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\sigma=\\left\\{W\\subseteq X\\times\\omega^\\omega:\\forall z\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_{\\mathcal B}\\;\\bigl(z\\in U\\times V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W\\bigr)\\right\\}\\land\\mathrm{BorelEvaluation}_S(B;X\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\sigma,c)\\land X\\setminus A=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The auxiliary evaluation predicate supplies the recursive complement/union semantics of the well-founded Borel code.</li>\n<li>The topology used to evaluate the code is the product topology generated by open rectangles; the Cartesian product <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\times\\tau_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\tau\\times\\tau_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> is not itself that topology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polish-space","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-polish-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code","status":"resolved","id":"4a54594b19acae3d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-baire-space-basic-open","status":"resolved","id":"6c99a52cfe56f7d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-baire-space-basic-open]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polish-space","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Polish}_S$ (Polish-space predicate, see [[58-df-polish-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code","status":"resolved","id":"4a54594b19acae3d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3BorelCode}_S$ (Borel-code predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-baire-space-basic-open","status":"resolved","id":"6c99a52cfe56f7d8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BaireSpaceBasicOpen}_S$ (basic-open predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-baire-space-basic-open]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq X\\times\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"(Y,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Polish}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3BorelCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BaireSpaceBasicOpen}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorelEvaluation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3CoanalyticCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}borel\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelEvaluation}_S(B;Y,\\sigma,c)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3BorelCode}_S(Y,\\sigma,c)\\land\\exists T,\\ell,E\\;\\Bigl(c=\\langle T,\\ell\\rangle\\land E:T\\to\\mathcal P(Y)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl((\\neg\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T))\\to E(s)=\\ell(s)\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\ell(s)=0\\to\\exists!n\\in\\omega\\;(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\land E(s)=Y\\setminus E(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle))\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\ell(s)=1\\to E(s)=\\bigcup\\{E(s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle):n\\in\\omega\\land s^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}\\bigr)\\land B=E(\\varnothing)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3CoanalyticCode}_S(X,\\tau,c,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\tau_{\\mathcal B}=\\left\\{U\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega:\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{BaireSpaceBasicOpen}_S(N,s)\\land y\\in N\\land N\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\right\\}\\land\\exists\\sigma\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\times\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\sigma=\\left\\{W\\subseteq X\\times\\omega^\\omega:\\forall z\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_{\\mathcal B}\\;\\bigl(z\\in U\\times V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W\\bigr)\\right\\}\\land\\mathrm{BorelEvaluation}_S(B;X\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\sigma,c)\\land X\\setminus A=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau\\times\\tau_{\\mathcal B}","display":false}],"bytes":3025,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1823","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-coanalytic-code.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive3-coanalytic-code]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","4b3a8629f6a6f868","4a54594b19acae3d","6c99a52cfe56f7d8"]}